<title>UK: Novorossiisk pipeline to close for 85 hours in Dec.</title>
<headline>Novorossiisk pipeline to close for 85 hours in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The main Urals crude export pipeline from Novorossiisk is to shut for 85 hours in December, shipping sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Further details on the timing of the closure were not immediately available, they said.</p>
<p>The D800 (800 mm) line transports about two thirds of the Urals exports from Novorossiisk.</p>
<p>At peak capacity the pipeline carries some 75,000-80,000 tonnes per day. The second pipeline, D500 (500 mm) transports the remainder of the crude, currently totalling 115,000 tonnes per day.</p>
<p>--Siobhan Hayden, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
